 "reviews": [
  {
   "stars": "★★★★★",
   "text": "“We had dinner there. We went because of the reviews and we liked it. You can order breakfast at any time of day and it's very substantial and delicious. I ordered a tortilla with cheese and ham, and it was very tasty and huge. We also ordered the most typical thing, the po'boys, and they were very g…”",
