  },
  {
   "stars": "★★★★★",
   "text": "“My husband and I went to Mother's restaurant on our 41st year wedding anniversary, for a mid'day meal while on vacation. We were highly satisfied with the food, service, and the welcoming atmosphere of all the employees.”",
   "who": "Dawn Norris · Google"
  },
  {
